 obviously we're taking our earnings up from $0.79 in Q3 to $0.82 to $0.86 or so, midpoint of $0.84 in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q3-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2018 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick Pedonti","x":"The DST acquisition and financing costs and severance costs impacted operating cash flow negatively by 244 million during the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2018 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick Pedonti","x":"Our LTM consolidated EBITDA, which we use for our covenant compliance, was 1,804,700,000 as of December '18 and includes 523.5 million of acquired EBITDA and cost savings related to the acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/15/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q4-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"It's a pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Kramm","x":"So can you just bridge the delta there from both maybe some of the stuff you talked about just now with the pass-through, but also what in the business maybe is running a little bit softer than you thought originally given that market's up, hedge funds are doing better, et cetera?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Pedonti","x":"Our LTM consolidated EBITDA, which we use for our covenant compliance, was $1.833 billion as of March '19 and includes $287.2 million of acquired EBITDA and cost savings related to acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Heckmann","x":"And so you're -- do you still feel confident, though, that the cost reduction at DST are not impeding your ability to reaccelerate the top line?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"I think we raised our guidance for the year up $0.05, I think, and I think we beat Q1 by $0.04.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rahul Kanwar","x":"Seven out of the top 10 M&A deals in North America used Intralinks in 2019 and we continue to invest in next generation capabilities, including artificial intelligence to derive insights from deal room data.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rahul Kanwar","x":"An existing SS&C Health client chose our business process management platform AWD to streamline their operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"James Faucette","x":"I just wanted to ask quick questions as it relates to development on pipeline, etc. And can you talk a little bit about what your conversion rates are on -- first, retention rates on the DTC product and then also on conversion rates around pipeline?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"We're also going through our entire client base and making sure that we get more methodical about price increases and making sure that we know where we are in the market and how we can maximize our opportunity and our current client base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"We've made a number of organizational changes to streamline our processes an enhance our clients offering and ultimately drive revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Pedonti","x":"Our LTM EBITDA, which we use for our covenants, was $1,868 million and includes $85 million of acquired EBITDA and cost savings related to the acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rahul Kanwar","x":"In our software businesses, Advent and institutional investment management, etc, we already had a reasonably good process for contractual price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brad Zelnick","x":"Last quarter, you talked about being more methodical about price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Pedonti","x":"Our LTM consolidated EBIDTA, which is used for the covenant compliance was $1,877.5 million as of December and includes $49.6 million of acquired EBITDA and cost savings related to the acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2019 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"And so, I think that we will continue to get more efficient, continue to get more productive, and I think that will translate into additional cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rahul Kanwar","x":"We also have some ability to pivot to other applications of the data rooms such as corporate restructuring efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Pedonti","x":"…unconsolidated affiliates; and $48.8 million of non-operating costs, including $31.4 million of severance costs related to staff reductions; $11.3 million loss on mark-to-market adjustment on investments; $6 million of foreign exchange impact. Effective tax rates we used for adjusted net income","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"Due to the uncertainty surrounding the global pandemic, we are withdrawing our 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Lee","x":"And is there any sort of appetite for further price increases in this environment?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rahul Kanwar","x":"And I think on the price increase process, we're pretty pleased with how that went at the end of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Pedonti","x":"Our LTM consolidated EBITDA that we use for covenant compliance was $1,864 [Phonetic] million as of June 2020 and includes $16.1 million of acquired EBITDA and cost savings related to our acquisitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Pedonti","x":"On an LTM consolidated basis EBITDA, which is used for our covenant compliance, was $1.876 billion as of September and includes $8 million of acquired EBITDA and cost savings related to our acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"We need to be able to build product, deliver product, market product, sell product, raise prices, right.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ashish Sabadra","x":"Are there opportunities for more annual price increases going forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2020 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"So there is added impetus to streamline your operations make much efficient as possible, make sure you have redundancy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/10/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rahul Kanwar","x":"And there really hasn't been much to report other than nobody's happy to get approached about a price increase, but we've had good constructive dialogue, there really has not been any fallout out of that process, and we think that our mission, which was to be able to have that conversation and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"And so I would say, yeah, of course what we have to raise our prices to get good assets because good assets are selling for higher price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"Earlier this month, we announced a reduction in force of 2.2% of our global employee base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"We have delayed our plans since the first quarter of 2020 and we have and will continue to treat everyone fairly, provide severance and transition assistance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"So I think they also understand that there will have to be some revenue adjustments to them, some price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick J. Pedonti","x":"It includes $1.8 million of acquired EBITDA and cost savings related to acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/ssc-technologies-holdings-inc-ssnc-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Stone","x":"And I think, that nobody likes price increases, people certainly understand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Lee","x":"How are you thinking about the magnitude and timing of price increases through the year and just given some of that wage inflation that you're seeing in the market?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick Pedonti","x":"Our consolidated EBITDA, which are used for our covenant compliance was $2.066 billion and includes $1.3 million of acquired EBITDA and cost savings related to our acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2021 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Young","x":"Just maybe wanted to start with the commentary about the staff cost increases and trying to offset those with some other cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q4-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2022 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Stone","x":"…that's necessarily a bad thing, I think for the short term, adjusting your sights on going for price increases and being able to move inflationary costs through to the revenue side, I think, is what we're working on and being sensitive to our employees and making sure that we remain an…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q1-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2022 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Lee","x":"So you had alluded to driving price increases to offset wage inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q1-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2022 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Stone","x":"Well, I think, Alex, that we have incorporated some price increases into our guidance and we are implementing as we speak and we have implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q2-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2022 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Stone","x":"And then, also, we've had individual businesses raising prices throughout.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q2-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2022 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2022-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"unknown","s":"Unknown Speaker","x":"Can you just comment on the nature of those potential headcount reductions?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/ssc-technologies-holdings-ssnc-q2-2022-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SSNC 2025 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2025-07-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Stone","x":"We are continuously investing in our AI strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/ssc-ssnc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2025 Q2","e":"ssnc","d":"2025-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Infante","x":"But any sense of the technical or commercial hurdles that would prevent you from routing a big chunk of SS&C administered flows through DMI over the next several years and maybe what that would mean from a cost savings perspective relative to Swift messaging.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/ssc-ssnc-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2025 Q4","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Stone","x":"Our investments in artificial intelligence and automation are paying off, and we're confident in our ability to drive margin expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/ssc-ssnc-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2026 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"The 2026 environment included a war in Iran, tariffs galore, spiking oil prices, and other macro headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ssc-ssnc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2026 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"Well, you know, you get hesitancy, Kevin, as you well know, when you have tariffs come flying out, and then you have war, and then you have spiking oil prices, which generally is going to increase inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ssc-ssnc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2026 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"Based on our performance and visibility today, we are raising 2026 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ssc-ssnc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2026 Q1","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Jeffrey Paul Schmitt","x":"What segments do you think have the most risk from AI, and what segments do you feel most confident are protected against disintermediation?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/ssc-ssnc-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2026 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-10-22","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"So you know, your assets are a DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/ssc-technologies-ssnc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2026 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rahul Kanwar","x":"…support our long-term growth and manage our expenses by controlling and aligning variable expenses, increasing productivity, and leveraging technology, and AI tools to improve our operating margins, strategically investing in the business, especially with respect to R&D and sales and marketing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/ssc-technologies-ssnc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2026 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-10-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"William C. Stone","x":"We exceeded expectations on revenue and margins and we are raising our outlook for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/ssc-technologies-ssnc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SSNC 2026 Q3","e":"ssnc","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick O'Shaughnessy","x":"Is there anywhere in your business where you are seeing some competitive disruption from AI native